
<section>
  메시지 전달을 위한 웹 서버 엔드포인트를 업데이트합니다.

  <api-endpoint method="POST" endpoint="/config/endpoint" contentType="application/json" />
</section>
<section>
  ## 요청

  <section>
  ### 본문

  ~~~json
  {
    "endpoint": "[YOUR_WEB_SERVER_URL]"
  }
  ~~~

  <params>
    <param-item param="endpoint" type="string">
    업데이트할 웹 서버 엔드포인트입니다.
    </param-item>
  </params>
  </section>
  <section>
  ### 예제

  ~~~bash
  curl -d '{"endpoint": "http://192.168.1.100:5000/new_messages"}' \
    -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
    -X POST http://[YOUR_DEVICE_IP]:[bot_http_port]/config/endpoint
  ~~~
  </section>
</section>
